          <span style=3D"color:#0078D4;font-weight:bold;">1.</span>&nbsp; <st=
rong>Azure AI Search index with custom skillset.</strong> Create a search ind=
ex with these fields beyond the standard content: <span style=3D"font-family:=
Consolas,monospace;font-size:12px;background:#F0F0F0;padding:1px 4px;border-r=
adius:3px;">project_name</span>, <span style=3D"font-family:Consolas,monospac=
