yle=3D"font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:12px;background:#F0F0F0;paddi=
ng:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;">related_artifacts[]</span>, <span style=3D"fon=
t-family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:12px;background:#F0F0F0;padding:1px 4px=
;border-radius:3px;">summary_context</span>. Add a custom skill that calls Az=
ure OpenAI to populate these fields during indexing. The <span style=3D"font-=
family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:12px;background:#F0F0F0;padding:1px 4px;b=
order-radius:3px;">related_artifacts</span> field is the key &#8212; it lists=
 other documents this one connects to, even across projects. Make <span style=
=3D"font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:12px;background:#F0F0F0;padding:=
1px 4px;border-radius:3px;">project_name</span> and <span style=3D"font-famil=
y:Consolas,monospace;font-size:12px;background:#F0F0F0;padding:1px 4px;border=
-radius:3px;">decisions</span> filterable, not just searchable.
