cument text, (b)&nbsp;call Azure OpenAI with a prompt like <em>"Extract the p=
roject name, key decisions, people mentioned, and any references to other pro=
jects or documents"</em>, (c)&nbsp;push the enriched document into Azure AI S=
earch via the Search REST API. This runs automatically as new content arrives=
 &#8212; no manual indexing.
