rong>Copilot Studio agent with generative answers.</strong> Create the agent,=
 add Azure AI Search as a knowledge source, and configure generative answers.=
 The critical piece: the <strong>custom system prompt</strong> that instructs=
 the agent to synthesize across projects. Use something like: <em>"When answe=
ring, search across all projects. If you find related decisions in different =
projects, explicitly connect them and cite both sources. Always state which p=
rojects your answer draws from."</em> This is what turns a basic search agent=
