rong>Plugin action: "Index this conversation."</strong> Build a Power Automat=
e cloud flow exposed as a plugin action. When a user pastes an exported chat =
history (from Copilot, Claude, ChatGPT), the flow parses it, extracts decisio=
ns and references, and indexes it into the same Azure AI Search instance. Thi=
s turns ephemeral conversations into durable, searchable knowledge nodes. Use=
rs actively feed the system.
